---
title: "2. Asking the chat assistant a question"
---
flowchart TD
    S([Visitor sends a message<br/>to the chat assistant]):::start --> A{More than 10 messages<br/>in the last minute?}:::question
    A -- Yes --> AX([Ask them to wait a moment]):::stop
    A -- No --> B{Is the message OK?<br/>not empty, not too long, and not<br/>trying to change the assistant's rules}:::question
    B -- No --> BX([Explain the message<br/>couldn't be sent]):::stop
    B -- Yes --> C[Add our instructions for the assistant<br/>and send the conversation<br/>to the AI service]:::step
    C --> D{Did the AI<br/>service answer?}:::question
    D -- No --> DX([Say the assistant is busy,<br/>please try again later]):::stop
    D -- Yes --> E[Show the reply on screen<br/>bit by bit as it arrives]:::step
    E --> G{Has the reply turned into<br/>code, such as a Python script?}:::question
    G -- Yes --> GX([Swap it for a polite refusal<br/>and offer a normal answer]):::stop
    G -- No --> F{Did the whole reply<br/>arrive within 2 minutes?}:::question
    F -- Yes --> OK([Reply complete]):::good
    F -- No --> FX([Tell them the reply<br/>was interrupted]):::stop

    N["The AI service's password (API key) stays on our server, so visitors can never see or misuse it."]:::note
    C -.- N
    N2["Our instructions tell the assistant to reply only in plain English sentences, as itself, about T Levels and placements: no code, poems, stories, characters or other languages."]:::note
    C -.- N2

    classDef start fill:#232f3e,stroke:#232f3e,color:#ffffff,font-weight:bold
    classDef step fill:#ffffff,stroke:#232f3e,color:#0f1111
    classDef question fill:#fff0d6,stroke:#a35c00,color:#0f1111
    classDef good fill:#e6f4ea,stroke:#1e7e34,color:#0f1111,font-weight:bold
    classDef stop fill:#fdecea,stroke:#b3261e,color:#0f1111
    classDef note fill:#f0f2f2,stroke:#6f7777,color:#0f1111,stroke-dasharray:4 3
